  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/precursorDiscovery1/text",
    "raw": "What...is this? How did we not detect this place? ^orange;Who built it?^reset; Can you please investigate? We've discovered the ruins of an unknown race!",
    "value": "这...是什么地方？我们之前怎么没探测到？^orange;是谁建造的？^reset;能否请您调查一下？我们发现了一个未知种族的遗迹！"
