    "raw": "Hmm. This door appears well sealed. Oh! It has a neat little missile icon on it! Perhaps some ^orange;explosive force^reset; might open it? A ^green;grenade, bomb or rocket^reset; should do the trick.",
    "value": "嗯，这扇门看起来封得很严实。哦！门上还有个精巧的小导弹图标！也许用点^orange;爆炸性的力量^reset;能打开它？^green;手榴弹、炸弹或者火箭弹^reset;应该能搞定。"
