    "raw": "Hmm. This switch is far enough from the door that entry without some sort of ^orange;swift boost or motion^reset; appears to be almost impossible.",
    "value": "嗯。这个开关离门太远了，如果没有某种^orange;快速的助推或移动方式^reset;，想要进去似乎几乎不可能。"
