  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/mamapoptop1/text",
    "raw": "The energy signatures within this cave are quite unusual. I'm getting definite trace readings of ^green;ancient essence^reset;, which doesn't make much sense. The ^#ff00fc;Ancients^reset; have no known historical presence in this sector.",
    "value": "这个洞穴内的能量特征相当异常。我检测到了明确的^green;古代精华^reset;残留读数，这实在令人费解。据我们所知，^#ff00fc;古人^reset;从未在这一区域有过活动记录。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/mamapoptop1/senderName",
    "raw": "Vinalisj",
    "value": "维纳利斯"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/mamapoptop1b/text",
    "raw": "Still...this reads as ^#ff00fc;Ancients^reset;, I'm almost positive. If these readings are accurate, we've stumbled across something truly significant. Press on! This is a rare chance for a true discovery.",
    "value": "不过...这看起来像是^#ff00fc;古人文字^reset;，我几乎可以肯定。如果这些解读准确无误，那我们真是碰上了极其重要的发现。继续前进！这可是千载难逢的发现真相的机会。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/mamapoptop1b/senderName",
    "raw": "Vinalisj",
    "value": "维纳利斯"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/mamapoptop1c/text",
    "raw": "I suppose it is safe to assume there is nobody here left alive. I can detect no trace of recent activity. I would estimate perhaps a decade since anyone has tread here.",
    "value": "我推测可以断定，这里已无人生还。我察觉不到任何近期活动的迹象。据我估计，此地大约已有十年无人踏足了。"
  },
