    "raw": "^orange;YES^reset;! This is ^green;definitely^reset; an energy signature linked with the ^#ff00fc;Ancients^reset;. It's coming from somewhere very close to your position.",
    "value": "^orange;是的^reset;！这^green;绝对^reset;是与^#ff00fc;古人^reset;相关的能量特征。它正从非常接近你当前位置的地方传来。"
