    "path": "/fubiomeradiation/text",
    "raw": "WARNING! RADIATION LEVELS ON THIS PLANET ARE EXTREMELY HAZARDOUS!\nYou should not attempt further exploration without proper protective equipment!",
    "value": "^red;警告！该行星辐射水平极度危险！^reset;\n未配备适当防护装备前，请勿继续深入探索！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fubiomepressure/text",
    "raw": "Greetings! You appear to be rapidly dying due to explosive decompression or extreme pressure. You should seek safety, and relatively quickly or face ^red;certain death^reset;!",
    "value": "注意！你似乎正因爆炸性减压或极端压力而迅速濒临死亡。请立即寻找安全区域，动作要快，否则将面临^red;生命危险^reset;！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fubiomepressure2/text",
    "raw": "I am uncertain why you came here. This isn't at all a place you are evolved to survive. You will be dead in mere moments without ^orange;pressure protection^reset;. I suggest procuring some.",
    "value": "我不确定你为何会来到这里。这里绝非你进化后能生存的环境。没有^orange;压强防护^reset;，你片刻之内就会丧命。我建议你尽快获取一些防护措施。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fubiomepressure3/text",
    "raw": "Have you gone mad? The pressure here is enough to crush you almost instantly! What would possess you to come unprotected? Get some ^orange;pressure protection^reset; or face death!",
    "value": "你疯了吗？这里的压力足以瞬间将你压垮！你怎么敢毫无防护地闯进来？赶紧找些^orange;压强防护^reset;措施，否则就是死路一条！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fubiomepressure4/text",
    "raw": "I regret to inform you that your decision to visit a ^red;gas giant^reset; without protection is a ^red;fatal^reset; one.",
    "value": "很遗憾地通知你，在没有防护的情况下前往^red;气态巨行星^reset;的决定是^red;致命^reset;的。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fubiomepressurenight/text",
    "raw": "Natural forces change the tide of gasses regularly with day and night cycle. As night approaches, you'll find things get a bit worse on your survival. Perhaps return later.",
    "value": "自然力量随昼夜更替规律性地改变气体流动。夜幕降临时，生存环境会变得稍显艰难。或许稍后再来更为妥当。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fubiomepressureday/text",
    "raw": "As the sun rises, warming the nascent gas of this world you find that the natural forces seem to calm and rapidly reduce in potence.",
    "value": "随着太阳升起，温暖了这个世界初生的气体，你发现自然之力似乎平息下来，其威力迅速减弱。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fubiomepressurewind/text",
    "raw": "While it is never exactly a pleasant calm day on a Gas Giant, extreme winds severely increase the effects of the environment. Take extra precautions.",
    "value": "在气态巨行星上，从未有过真正平静宜人的日子，而极端的风力会显著加剧环境的恶劣影响。请务必格外小心。"
  },
  {
